WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.020
Yusei, you're my hope!

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.920
Accel Synchro surpasses light!

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.890
Surpass the light and open the future!

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:11.790
Go, Yusei!

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.730
Bruno!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.130
Yusei...

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:30.940
Bruno!

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:41.820
The door.

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:44.490
Yusei stopped the final gear!

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:48.800
It's Yusei!

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:49.850
Yusei!

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:51.880
Yusei!

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.870
Everyone, you're okay.

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:54.600
Yeah.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:56.570
Yusei, look at this!

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:58.060
You have a Mark.

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:00.720
I'm the sixth Signer!

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.890
I'm just like Yusei and Jack!

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:07.360
Yusei, I wish you could 
have seen Lua's duel.

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:10.860
If it wasn't for Lua, we couldn't have 
stopped the Yusei Gear.

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:11.950
Well...

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:14.830
You're exaggerating!

00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:15.990
Lua, well done.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:18.220
Yusei!

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:22.420
Sherry...

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:27.160
I've decided to battle alongside you.

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:33.840
I understand.

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:37.660
Yusei, where's the guy with the sunglasses?

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:42.390
He's gone.

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:45.020
He was the guardian of the Yusei Gear.

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:47.580
He was Bruno.

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:49.720
Bruno?

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:51.420
Yeah.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.150
What do you mean?

00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:54.520
Why Bruno?

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:58.280
Bruno's real name is Antinomy.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:03.630
Like Aporia, Z-one sent him here 
in order to change the future.

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:05.880
Bruno was Z-one's servant?

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:08.840
Does that mean Bruno was our enemy?

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.070
No!

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:15.040
It's true that Z-one sent Bruno.

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:19.660
However, Bruno really did
want to battle alongside us.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:23.520
That's why Bruno taught me 
something while he battled me.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:26.950
A new power I need to battle Z-one.

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:28.490
A new power?

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:31.960
It's called Delta Accel Synchro.

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:34.430
Delta Accel Synchro?

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:39.680
He sacrificed himself to save me.

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:42.870
That means Bruno is...

00:02:43.270 --> 00:02:44.320
Yeah.

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:46.730
He entrusted us with the future.

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:48.940
Bruno...

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:53.100
I'll make him pay!

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.380
How dare he use Bruno
to guard the Yusei Gear!

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:58.520
Sherry, Z-one is up ahead, right?

00:02:58.520 --> 00:02:59.340
Yes.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.680
Let's go, Yusei!

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.350
To get Bruno's revenge.

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:06.330
I won't stay quiet after he 
used a friend as a shield!

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:08.790
Yeah! Let's go!

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:10.710
To Z-one!

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:21.010
Team 5D's, you're finally coming.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.590
Riding Duels.

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:27.420
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:34.280
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:42.330
Run! The road of evolution leading to tomorrow

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:46.870
Is a new legendary duel

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:03.830
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:09.450
Set free your infinite potential

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:15.060
Every beginning is up to you

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:21.670
Everyone is lost Pursue the light

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:26.970
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:32.540
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:40.390
Become the gale and dance Cut through the darkness

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:45.590
Even if you can't see your destination

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:51.060
Run on your feet without fear

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:56.930
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:04:56.930 --> 00:05:04.460
Going my way!! Break through and go!

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:23.760
The Final Human  Z-one

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:38.380
What is this place?

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.070
How far do we have to climb?

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.680
Look at that!

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:49.100
It's the old Moment.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:53.250
The old Moment's energy
is powering the Sun Gear.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.410
My destiny isn't over yet.

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:12.310
What is this place?

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.570
It's full of junk.

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:18.250
Welcome, Team 5D's.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:19.240
This way!

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:31.920
Z-one!

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.530
You finally showed yourself!

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:36.670
That's Z-one?

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.000
Huh?

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:45.470
I've seen your duels.

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:50.440
Team 5D's, you fought well.

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:54.150
And Sherry, you joined them?

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:56.590
I won't look at my past anymore!

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:58.620
I'll only look towards the future!

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:02.090
For the sake of the future,
we'll eliminate you!

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:05.290
We won't let you destroy Neo Domino City!

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:10.460
I promised Bruno that
we would save the future!

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.650
With Antinomy?

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:16.660
What do you think you can do?

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:22.740
The Synchro Summon that you're using
led the world to destruction.

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:27.590
Yusei Fudo, if there was
no Synchro Summoning,

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:32.450
the Moment that your father invented 
wouldn't have gone out of control.

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:35.920
Humanity wouldn't have perished.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:44.390
Moment and Synchro Summoning led to
 a future of destruction and despair.

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:50.470
In order to change that future, 
I caused Zero Reverse

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:54.200
to destroy Moment, which was
the source of the problem.

00:07:57.350 --> 00:08:03.950
I also sent Paradox to destroy
the reason for everything - Duel Monsters.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:05.680
Paradox?

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:09.750
That was you, too?

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:19.590
My plan that used Aporia and 
Antinomy is now about to be fulfilled.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:23.380
By dropping Ark Cradle on Neo Domino City,

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:27.000
both the City and Moment
will be destroyed.

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:32.780
That's why you erased Bruno's
memories and sent him to us.

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.480
You think you had the right to do that?

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:39.180
Because of you, Bruno was...

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:42.150
I'll stop Ark Cradle!

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:46.320
We live in this city!
Bruno lived in this city!

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:48.520
We won't let you destroy it!

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:51.830
Fine.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:54.860
Then defeat me in a duel.

00:08:55.750 --> 00:09:00.420
I am linked to the Sun 
Gear that powers Ark Cradle.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:05.040
If you don't defeat me in 
a duel, the Sun Gear won't stop.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.410
I'll take you on, Z-one!

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:09.310
Wait, Yusei Fudo.

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:12.250
Aporia!

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.210
You're alive?

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:19.650
Z-one.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.620
I'll be your opponent.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:23.790
What?

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:24.920
Why?

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:26.330
Why Aporia?

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:33.000
We survived together in the apocalyptic 
future, so it's my duty as his friend.

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:34.520
Duty?

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:35.600
What do you mean?

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:40.810
By dueling you, I discovered an answer.

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:42.010
Answer?

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:47.480
Why did I continue to live when 
I suffered so much despair?

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:56.700
I lost my parents and my girlfriend, 
so I was alone in the world.

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:02.330
Even though I suffered three 
despairs, I kept walking.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:04.060
That's because...

00:10:04.690 --> 00:10:07.930
Even though I suffered despair,
I didn't lose hope.

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:11.570
That's right.

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:14.310
I was searching for hope.

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:18.140
That's why I was able to keep walking.

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:22.710
Because I believed that within
 despair, there was still hope!

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:27.560
I realized that when I dueled you.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:32.160
Z-one, I want you to remember.

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:35.130
Remember the hope
you had for Yusei!

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:38.600
Z-one has hope for us?

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:42.920
In order to complete the Circuit

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:47.270
and make the Ark Cradle appear, 
you sent me to Neo Domino City.

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:54.610
In order to perfect the Circuit, you sent 
Antinomy to help Team 5D's grow.

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:57.770
But why did you erase Antinomy's memories?

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:01.370
Because it would only hinder your plans.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:07.180
They've evolved so much that 
they're now trying to stop Ark Cradle.

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:12.530
Maybe this evolution is 
what you were hoping for!

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:14.670
Z-one wanted us to evolve?

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:20.720
5D's may be able to evolve far 
enough to change humanity's future.

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:25.540
Since that's what you thought,
you sent Antinomy to Yusei.

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:29.740
You entrusted your final hope 
to humanity's potential!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:33.560
So why are you trying to kill them

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:37.620
when they've evolved and 
can now be entrusted with the future?

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:40.560
Z-one!

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:49.230
Hope is an illusion.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:52.420
But you held on to hope.

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:55.310
I want you to remember that!

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:57.670
Aporia!

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:03.510
Let's battle, Z-one!

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:07.950
But your body is...

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:15.590
Kid, I saw hope in you.

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:20.440
I learned that your growth

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:27.180
and your bond with Team 5D's
were the hope I was looking for.

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:30.770
As long as there's hope, I can fight!

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:31.950
But...

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:32.920
Let him battle.

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:37.340
This is his decision.

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.950
You really want to battle me?

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:46.620
Then it can't be helped.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:50.760
I will bury you first, Aporia.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:15.370
What's happening?

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:30.250
That's Z-one's deck.

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:31.770
It's huge!

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:34.570
Watch, 5D's.

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:36.200
This is Z-one's power!

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:37.960
Duel!

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:52.520
I go first! My turn!

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:54.790
I summon Grand Core.

00:13:55.780 --> 00:13:59.490
I activate the spell card
Chaos Bloom from my hand.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:03.050
When there are no cards with 
the same name in my graveyard,

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:07.200
one monster with 1000-or-fewer 
attack points is destroyed.

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:09.140
I destroy Grand Core!

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:15.640
When an effect destroys Grand Core,
from my deck, hand or graveyard,

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:19.020
I can Special Summon
Level 1 Meklord Emperor Granel,

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:25.650
Granel Top, Granel Attack, Granel 
Guard and Granel Carrier!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.620
Combine, Meklord Emperor Granel!

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:36.530
Meklord Emperor Granel's attack 
points are equal to my life points.

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:40.300
Meklord Emperor Granel!

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:42.030
4000 attack points!

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:45.470
He summoned Granel on his first turn!

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:48.110
He already summoned Granel.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:50.280
That means Z-one is a powerful foe.

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:53.340
I set one card and end my turn.

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:56.520
Meklord Emperor Granel...

00:14:56.950 --> 00:15:00.510
Aporia, you know how strong I am.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:04.490
Do you really think you can
beat me with that weak card?

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:08.080
He's calling Granel a "weak card."

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:10.390
What monster is he going to summon?

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:13.620
My turn. I draw.

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.100
I summon Time Angel.

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.580
0 attack points?

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:24.810
He said Granel was a weak card, but he 
summoned a monster with 0 attack points.

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:28.200
Time Angel attacks Meklord Emperor Granel.

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:35.250
Attacking with 0 attack points means he'll 
take 4000 points of damage and lose!

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.220
Take it on, Granel!

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:44.990
From my hand, I activate 
the trap Foolish Decision.

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:45.850
What?

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:47.360
Activate a trap from your hand?

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:48.630
And without any requirements?

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:52.130
I take 0 battle damage.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:53.970
He defended himself.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:16:02.140
When Time Angel is destroyed in battle, all 
monsters on the field return to their owners' hands.

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:02.900
What?

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:10.960
Granel returned to his hand.

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:15.300
Since he doesn't have Grand Core, 
summoning it again will take five turns.

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:16.690
It's the same as sealing it away.

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:21.750
I activate the trap Magician's 
Adage from my hand.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.360
From his hand again!

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:24.160
A trap!

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:29.690
For every card that was returned to the
 hand, you take 300 points of damage.

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:34.110
Since it was five cards, you 
take 1500 points of damage.

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.010
Aporia!

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:44.410
I'm fine.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.660
This amount of damage
won't stop me from fighting.

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:53.460
You gave me hope!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.280
Aporia...

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.230
Hope...

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:03.500
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:05.070
My turn!

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:07.380
I summon Wise Core.

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:13.010
I activate the spell card 
Chaos Blast from my hand.

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:20.480
I send three cards in my deck to the graveyard 
to destroy one Level 4-or-below monster.

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:22.570
I destroy Wise Core.

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:28.520
When an effect destroys Wise Core,
from my deck, hand or graveyard,

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:31.140
I can Special Summon Level 1
 Meklord Emperor Wisel,

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:33.660
Wisel Top,

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:35.560
Wisel Attack,

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:37.570
Wisel Guard

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:41.250
and Wisel Carrier!

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:44.020
Combine, Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:50.480
It's Meklord Emperor Wisel this time!

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:54.120
Meklord Emperor Wisel attacks Z-one directly!

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:57.770
He can do it!

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:58.390
No...

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:02.860
I activate the trap Empress's 
Staff from my hand.

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:06.570
Another trap from his hand?
That's not fair!

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:09.930
A trap card usually 
activates after it's set.

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:12.680
But he can activate them from his hand.

00:18:12.680 --> 00:18:14.570
We can't anticipate his strategy!

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:18.030
When there are no monsters on my field,

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:22.320
your monster's attack is negated, 
and the Battle Phase ends.

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:25.050
And you take 500 points of damage.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.160
Aporia!

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.630
Let's stop.

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:42.640
There is no hope for the future.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:44.540
There is only despair.

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:48.600
Aporia, you know that best.

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:52.410
If we continue, it will 
only deepen your despair.

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:55.110
You cannot defeat me.

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:57.000
I'm not done.

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:59.180
The battle is only beginning.

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:03.420
I set one card and end my turn.

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:05.740
You still want to fight?

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:07.990
Then it can't be helped.

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:11.720
I will show you true despair.

00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:14.160
My turn.

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:17.830
I activate the Continuous
Trap Nonexistence.

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:21.390
When there are no monsters on my field,

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:25.450
I can summon a Level 10-or-above
monster without tribute,

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:27.960
and it will have 0 attack points.

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:31.280
What?  Summon a Level 10-or-above monster?

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:34.250
Appear, Metaion, the Timelord.

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:48.920
Metaion, the Timelord has appeared.

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:50.490
It's your ace monster!

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:53.740
That's Z-one's ace monster?

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:55.850
An ace monster with 0 attack points?

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:58.200
What effects does it have?

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:02.170
Metaion, the Timelord attacks 
Meklord Emeror Wisel.

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:11.880
Metaion isn't destroyed, and 
battle damage becomes 0.

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:13.720
He got rid of the damage!

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:18.570
Since Metaion battled, 
after the end of the Battle Phase,

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:22.540
all monsters on your field 
return to your hand,

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:27.160
and you take 300 points of 
damage for each one.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.380
What?

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:41.460
Aporia!

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:47.020
Since it can't be destroyed in battle, you 
can only destroy it with spells or traps.

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:51.250
No. Metaion, the Timelord can't be destroyed.

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:53.720
Then how?

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:56.820
Metaion, the Timelord is an omnipotent god.

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:59.700
No one can defeat it.

00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:02.560
But I won't lose.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:04.800
As long as I have hope!

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:07.770
My turn!

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:10.230
It's here!

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:12.810
As long as I have this card, I can fight.

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:15.000
This card of hope creates miracles.

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:17.150
I summon Sky Core!

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:23.120
He's planning to summon 
Meklord Emperor Skiel.

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:27.150
But even if he attacks Metaion,
the Timelord with Skiel,

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:29.590
it will be returned to his hand, 
and he will take damage.

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:33.560
If he takes 1500 points of 
damage again, it's over.

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:40.000
What are you planning to do, Aporia?

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:44.940
Everything rests on this turn.

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:11.360
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:16.740
If we shed the same tears, let's laugh together

00:22:16.740 --> 00:22:22.110
Freed reality forms phrases in the piercing beat

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:24.880
Our hearts resonate

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:30.080
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:36.690
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.560 --> 00:22:43.800
Waking in a dream Stretch our hands toward the future

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:48.830
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:55.010
Repaint the darkness with the colors we envision

00:22:55.010 --> 00:23:03.310
Overlaying memories, bonds and hope creates future color

00:23:03.310 --> 00:23:09.220
We will draw it forever
